<!-- KStorm Lighting proxy header (KSFloaterLightingProxy): a header-only stand-in, docked left of
     the launcher, for an AyaneStorm floater too large to dock. Registered three times
     (ks_lighting_proxy_env_effects, _viewer_lights, _camera_effects); the title comes from code.
